        >>> np.save('/tmp/123', np.array([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]))
        >>> np.load('/tmp/123.npy')
        array([[1, 2, 3],
               [4, 5, 6]])

        Store compressed data to disk, and load it again:

        >>> a=np.array([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]])
        >>> b=np.array([1, 2])
